Replace OVN metadata agent with OVN agent extension

Neutron removed the standalone neutron-ovn-metadata-agent in change
I5cca341d80e41a820d63085766c91e3917026f83, so its container no longer
starts on master. Serve metadata from the metadata extension of
neutron-ovn-agent instead, and remove the old container on upgrade.

The agent wrapper environment moves to neutron-ovn-agent, so HAProxy
keeps running in separate containers when neutron_agents_wrappers is
set. Those of the old agent are removed on upgrade, as they would
otherwise still hold the metadata address in each namespace.

